{
  "body_human_readable": "Here are the real GDP growth forecasts (percent change) for 2023 and 2024 for the requested countries:\n\n- **India**: \n  - 2023: 8.2%\n  - 2024: 6.5%\n\n- **China**: \n  - 2023: 5.2%\n  - 2024: 4.8%\n\n- **Brazil**: \n  - 2023: 3.2%\n  - 2024: 3.7%\n\n- **Japan**: \n  - 2023: 1.5%\n  - 2024: -0.2%\n\n- **United States**: \n  - 2023: 2.9%\n  - 2024: 2.8% [1]",
